---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Guarantee | FileLocker Online" 
  description="Your privacy is guaranteed because we never see your files. FileLocker processes everything locally on your device."
>
  <div class="w-full bg-[#f8fafc] min-h-screen py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Your Privacy is Guaranteed</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-500">
          We built FileLocker because we were tired of "free" security tools secretly uploading files to their servers. We do things differently.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 space-y-10">
        
        <div class="border-b border-gray-100 pb-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-50 text-green-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">No Uploads. No Servers.</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">
            FileLocker is a <strong class="text-gray-900">100% client-side application</strong>. This means that all of the complex password-protection math happens directly inside the memory of your web browser. 
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            We do not have a server that receives your files. If you disconnect your internet after loading the page, FileLocker will still work perfectly.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-b border-gray-100 pb-10">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-50 text-brand-blue rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">We Cannot See Your Password</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Because everything happens on your computer, your password never travels across the internet. We have absolutely no way to see, store, or recover your password if you lose it. Your files are truly yours.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-purple-50 text-purple-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" /></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">No Accounts Required</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Privacy tools shouldn't require your email address. You don't need to sign up or create an account to use FileLocker. It is a free utility designed to be used instantly whenever you need to secure data before sharing it.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
